    "text": "RUN DONT WALK! hands down the best jjm I’ve had in Berlin 완전 맛있어 진짜 맛있어 대박 맛있음(요)\n\n📍 hängbok (in Charlottenburg)\n- there are 2 jjm types, the regular & seafood version (seafood version is 3€ more I think)\n- jjm jajangmyun 짜장면 is black bean noodles, with pork\n- tangsuyuk 탕수육 is fried pork with sweet and sour sauce\n- jjm cost 15€\n- tangsusyuk cost 25€ (good for sharing)\n- incredible service, delicious taste, and PACKED with Koreans (so it’s the real deal)\n\n#koreanfood #리뷰 #livingabroad #abroadlife #expatlife\n\nkorean food in berlin, korean food in germany, korean restaurant reviews, living in germany, living in berlin, 한국 음식점 독일, 한국 음식점 벨를린, 한국 음식점 리뷰",
